<title>FINLAND: TABLE - Helsingin Puhelin H1 profit surges.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Helsingin Puhelin H1 profit surges.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax	88 vs 28</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.67 vs 0.48</p>
<p> Turnover					   1,222 vs 1,044</p>
<p> Operating profit				   102 vs 44</p>
<p>Helsingin Puhelin, a telecoms operator in the Helsinki capital region, said in a statement it would launch a rights issue and apply for a bourse listing.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 248</p>
